{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/sdc01_0230.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/sdc01_0230.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_gfather_01",
      "hash64": "B61F513772593802",
      "text": "说来话长，\\n你要听吗？[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_gfather_02",
      "hash64": "B61F50377259364F",
      "text": "等你想听的时候，\\n就来告诉我吧。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_gfather_03",
      "hash64": "B61F4F377259349C",
      "text": "我也是从我父亲那里听来的……\\n这个故事只在我们一族内口口相传。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_gfather_04",
      "hash64": "B61F4E37725932E9",
      "text": "这是个真实的故事，\\n不能告诉村子里的其他人。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_gfather_05",
      "hash64": "B61F4D3772593136",
      "text": "你们绝对不可外传。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_sister_01",
      "hash64": "58DB3930F6695A99",
      "text": "嗯，我知道了……[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_01",
      "hash64": "487E69A94330FA57",
      "text": "很久很久以前，有个来自异国他乡的\\n男人和鬼迷路来到了北上乡。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_02",
      "hash64": "487E6AA94330FC0A",
      "text": "村里的人们害怕他们\\n不同于自己的外表……[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_03",
      "hash64": "487E6BA94330FDBD",
      "text": "于是便不允许\\n男人和鬼靠近自己的村子。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_04",
      "hash64": "487E64A94330F1D8",
      "text": "男人和鬼因为没有受到\\n村民们的欢迎而感到很难过……[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_05",
      "hash64": "487E65A94330F38B",
      "text": "但是只要能在一起，他们就很幸福了，\\n于是就在后山的洞窟过起了简朴的生活。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_06",
      "hash64": "487E66A94330F53E",
      "text": "只有村里的面具工匠\\n觉得他们很可怜……[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_07",
      "hash64": "487E67A94330F6F1",
      "text": "于是就帮男人和鬼\\n制作了好几个面具。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_08",
      "hash64": "487E60A94330EB0C",
      "text": "面具上装饰着男人从异国带来的宝石，\\n闪闪发光，华丽至极。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_09",
      "hash64": "487E61A94330ECBF",
      "text": "只要戴上面具，就能把脸遮住，\\n和村民们友好相处。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_10",
      "hash64": "4881EEA94334122D",
      "text": "男人和鬼因为面具工匠的和善\\n而感到非常高兴，并对工匠感激不已。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_11",
      "hash64": "4881EDA94334107A",
      "text": "从此，男人和鬼会戴上面具，\\n偷偷参加村子的庆典。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_12",
      "hash64": "4881ECA943340EC7",
      "text": "这对神秘组合的面具\\n巧夺天工，很快大受好评。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_13",
      "hash64": "4881EBA943340D14",
      "text": "消息甚至一下子就\\n传到了许多遥远的国度。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_14",
      "hash64": "4881EAA943340B61",
      "text": "或许是听到了这世间罕见的\\n闪亮面具的传闻……[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_15",
      "hash64": "4881E9A9433409AE",
      "text": "几只贪得无厌的宝可梦\\n来到了北上乡。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_16",
      "hash64": "4881E8A9433407FB",
      "text": "它们偷偷潜入\\n男人和鬼的住处……[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_17",
      "hash64": "4881E7A943340648",
      "text": "企图夺走\\n被悉心保管的面具。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_18",
      "hash64": "4881E6A943340495",
      "text": "男人碰巧在场，\\n勉强保住了一个面具……[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_19",
      "hash64": "4881E5A9433402E2",
      "text": "但心有余而力不足，\\n剩下３个面具都被宝可梦们夺走了。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_20",
      "hash64": "488554A94336F556",
      "text": "几个时辰后，\\n当鬼回到洞窟后……[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_21",
      "hash64": "488555A94336F709",
      "text": "它发现那里只留下了\\n争斗的痕迹和绿色的面具。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_22",
      "hash64": "488552A94336F1F0",
      "text": "或许是为了寻找男人，\\n鬼戴着绿色的面具下山前往村子。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_23",
      "hash64": "488553A94336F3A3",
      "text": "然后……把举着闪闪发光的面具\\n乐开花的宝可梦们通通干掉了。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_24",
      "hash64": "488558A94336FC22",
      "text": "毫不知情的村民们\\n对眼前发生的事情一头雾水。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_25",
      "hash64": "488559A94336FDD5",
      "text": "他们看到的只是鬼大发雷霆的样子，\\n并对此感到非常害怕。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_26",
      "hash64": "488556A94336F8BC",
      "text": "村民们以为是那３只宝可梦\\n从鬼的魔掌中守护了村子。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_27",
      "hash64": "488557A94336FA6F",
      "text": "于是亲切地称它们为宝伴，\\n并厚葬了它们。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_28",
      "hash64": "48855CA9433702EE",
      "text": "受伤的鬼沉浸在悲伤之中，\\n独自回到后山的洞窟去了。[VAR 0x0114(0030)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0030"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc01_0230_history_29",
      "hash64": "48855DA9433704A1",
      "text": "[EMPTY 35]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
